2026-10-25T03:15:38.1995150Z [1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer[0m
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2720670Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2754830Z [0m
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2756040Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2758970Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2761190Z 
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2761400Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2761780Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2762010Z 
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2762160Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2762450Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2762600Z 
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2762900Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [351..356])[0m and groups [34m(gid 350)[0m
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2763310Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2763650Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2763940Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2764070Z 
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2764210Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2764420Z 
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2764580Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2764890Z    can use Nix.
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2765010Z 
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2765090Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2765220Z 
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2765440Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2765790Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2821040Z 
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2823870Z I will:
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2825890Z 
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2830050Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2831590Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2832060Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2833320Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2834670Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2834970Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2835940Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2836410Z    /var/root
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2853680Z  - back up /etc/bashrc to /etc/bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2855420Z  - update /etc/bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2891700Z  - back up /etc/zshrc to /etc/zshrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2893690Z  - update /etc/zshrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2894250Z  - create a Nix volume and a LaunchDaemon to mount it
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2894790Z  - create a LaunchDaemon (at /Library/LaunchDaemons/org.nixos.nix-daemon.plist) for nix-daemon
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2895250Z 
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2895720Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-10-25T03:15:38.2896090Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
